  "passage": "Subject: My unexpected adventure! Hi Sam, How are you? I'm writing to tell you about my unexpected weekend. It all started when my cousin's arrival was delayed, so I decided to go on a last-minute trip to the seaside with my partner, Jamie. We met a lovely couple, Mr. and Mrs. Green, who were on their honeymoon. They introduced us to their friend, Captain Roberts, who owned a small boat. He offered to take us out for a sail, but we needed a permit from the harbour master. After some paperwork, we got the permit and set off. The trip was fantastic! We saw dolphins and even helped clean up some rubbish in the water. I have some great photos, but I accidentally deleted a few from my camera. Anyway, it was an amazing experience. Write back soon and tell me about your weekend. Best, Alex",
